                                        "entry_id": "63c7db0c-9267-3e2e-a115-0f81a84299b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a goldish-yellow colour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d9396b5-5ccc-4ef4-b92b-e0a148abd73f",
                                                "sense_id": "52d37e60-0c6b-3628-80e8-797ee37e1028",
                                                "text": "The coin […] bore what I at first thought was a woman's face—a woman crowned, neither young nor old, but silent and perfect in the citrine metal."
